      <description>ARLINGTON, VIRGINIA – FEBRUARY 10: Buddhist monks continue their March for Peace as they cross Chain Bridge over the Potomac River February 10, 2026 between Arlington, Virginia and Washington, DC. A group of 18 monks began their march to raise awareness of “peace, loving kindness and compassion” in the United States and the world on October 26 in Fort Worth, Texas and will arrive in the nation’s capital tomorrow.</description>
